@startuml
title Diagram 3 — Peta Modul & Dependensi (M1–M8)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

package "Fondasi" {
  [M1 · Tenancy & Kendali Akses] as M1
}

package "Mandatory (MVP)" {
  [M2 · Contact & Account] as M2
  [M3 · Lead Management] as M3
  [M4 · Pipeline / Opportunity] as M4
  [M7 · Reporting & Analytics] as M7
}

package "MVP minimal" {
  [M8 · Webhook / Event Layer] as M8
}

package "Nice to have" {
  [M5 · Activity Management] as M5
}

M1 --> M2
M1 --> M3
M1 --> M4
M1 --> M7
M1 --> M8

M3 --> M2 : konversi lead
M4 --> M2 : peluang merujuk kontak/akun
M7 ..> M4 : revenue & pipeline
M7 ..> M3 : data lead
M7 ..> M2 : data pelanggan
M5 ..> M2
M5 ..> M4
M8 ..> M3 : event perubahan status lead
M8 ..> M4 : event pergerakan peluang

note bottom of M1
  M1 adalah fondasi — isolasi data antar tenant
  tidak dapat ditambahkan belakangan tanpa rework.
end note

note bottom of M8
  Event outbound inti + 1 endpoint inbound (DEC-021).
  Retry, rate limit, logging, fan-out (DEC-030).
end note

note top of M7
  M6 Ticketing DIKELUARKAN dari MVP
  (CR-20261008-001 / DEC-043) — domain service,
  bukan core CRM untuk sales tracking.
end note
@enduml
